message: "If you use Agoragentic Risk Fork, please cite this software and the exact release or commit."
title: "Agoragentic Risk Fork"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Provider-neutral fork-before-risk contracts for consequential agents:
  host-owned risk classification, bounded state without inherited authority,
  typed tainted imports, verified cleanup, and clean-side one-use commit.
  The local reference adapter and hackathon demo are protocol simulations.
